From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kutluhaneth46 <kutluhaneth46@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:38:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(foundation): use structured context in log messages

Migrate foundation log calls away from template-literal interpolation
to static messages with structured context objects, matching
yarn-project/CLAUDE.md logging guidance and avoiding eager string
construction on hot/disabled log paths.

Part of AztecProtocol/aztec-packages#13035.

